2. **`lighthouse-core/audits/metrics/interactive.js`**: This file uses the computed quiet periods to calculate the TTI metric.

The problem seems to be in the function `findOverlappingQuietPeriods` in `interactive.js`, where it throws an error if it cannot find overlapping quiet periods. The logic might not handle cases where the page becomes idle immediately after FCP.

